# Alur mitra: pesanan masuk, serahkan dengan kode, dashboard, listing. Akun: owner-m1@example.com / Password123!
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3030/api/v1

### Login mitra
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner-m1@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

### Toko saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/merchant
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Ubah profil toko (todays_offer kosong = hapus)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/me/merchant
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "todays_offer": "Es teler beli 2 gratis 1", "open_hours": "07.00 - 21.00" }

### Dashboard hari ini
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/merchant/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Pesanan masuk (tanpa kode pickup)
# @name inbox
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/merchant/orders?status=ready
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Serahkan pesanan: ketik kode dari layar pembeli (4 digit atau SG-1234)
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/merchant/orders/{{inbox.response.body.$.data[0].id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "0000" }

### Batalkan (alasan wajib)
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/merchant/orders/{{inbox.response.body.$.data[0].id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Bahan habis" }

### Katalog saya (status turunan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/merchant/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Upload foto listing (ganti path file), lalu pakai id-nya di bawah
# @name photo
POST {{baseUrl}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=sg

--sg
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="purpose"

listing
--sg
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="foto.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./foto.jpg
--sg--

### Buat listing makanan. made_at harus < batas aman (suhu ruang 4 jam). Ganti waktu dengan 1 jam lalu (UTC).
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: coba-listing-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nasi Goreng Spesial",
  "tier": "human",
  "price": 15000,
  "price_original": 30000,
  "stock": 6,
  "made_at": "2026-10-17T00:00:00Z",
  "storage": "room_temp",
  "safety_checks": ["untouched", "sensory_ok", "stored_right", "packed_clean"],
  "pickup_hours": 2,
  "photo_media_ids": ["{{photo.response.body.$.data.id}}"]
}
